  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.03 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Licensing for Alcohol and Other Drug Use Professionals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.03 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Licensing for Alcohol and Other Drug Use Professionals. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.3, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the board of licensing for alcohol and other drug use professionals under RSA 330-C:\n\nTable 1002.3 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Board of Licensing for Alcohol and Other Drug Use Professionals\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nMaster alcohol and drug counselor license application processing and licensing:\n\nActive: initial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $233\n\nInactive: initial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $116\n\nChange from inactive status to active status not in conjunction with renewal | $116\n\nAlcohol and drug counselor license application processing and licensing:\n\nActive: initial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $110\n\nInactive: initial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $55\n\nChange from inactive status to active status not in conjunction with renewal | $55\n\nClinical supervisor license application processing and licensing:\n\nActive: initial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $110\n\nInactive: initial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $55\n\nChange from inactive status to active status not in conjunction with renewal | $55\n\nRecovery support worker certification application processing and licensing:\n\nActive: initial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $48\n\nInactive: initial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $24\n\nChange from inactive status to active status not in conjunction with renewal | $24\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
}
